---
---

<section class="about section" aria-labelledby="about">
  <div class="page">
    <h2 class="statement reveal" id="about">
      Consistly is more than a habit tracker.
      <span>
        It turns the small things you do each day into something you can see, a
        companion that grows with you, and rewards worth coming back for.
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="belief reveal">
      Consistency isn't about being perfect. It's about getting a little better
      every day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .statement {
    max-width: 980px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.6vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.032em;
    line-height: 1.12;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .statement span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .belief {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    /* Keeps the belief line clear of the colored section below. */
    .about {
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .statement span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .statement {
      font-size: clamp(21px, 6vw, 28px);
      line-height: 1.16;
    }

    .belief {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-left: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>
